RRSI decision rules and search design are adapted from google-research/rrsi,
commit be50316e1db05914068a973f322770ef08ed7ba1 (Apache License 2.0).
The adaptations use Task contracts, immutable method assets, native DSH execution,
explicit missing evidence, a +25% cost ceiling and deterministic slot ordering.
See src/strategy/decision.ts, docs/divergence-ledger.md and third_party/rrsi/LICENSE.
The complete upstream implementation is not included.

