commit 639ed015397290b3745d163aafe02ffee4aa3f84 (MIT, Copyright 2026 DeepSeek).
They retain log-only session events, correct memory pressure accounting, and add pending-only wake.
scripts/build-private-dsh.mjs rebuilds the pinned external host with these source patches.
